OL,3,GNEWSASandie Peggie's views had 'no
OL,4,Abearing' on refusing legal support,
OL,5,Aunion says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nursing union has told a tribunal it
OL,8,Fdid not give Sandie Peggie legal advice
OL,9,Fbecause her case did not fit with its
OL,10,Frules ` and that the decision had
OL,11,Fnothing to do with her gender critical
OL,12,Fviews.
OL,14,FPeggie claims the Royal College of
OL,15,FNursing (RCN) failed to properly
OL,16,Fsupport and advise her after she was
OL,17,Fsuspended over a complaint about her
OL,18,Fbehaviour by a transgender doctor. The
OL,19,FRCN disputes the claim.
