OL,3,GNEWSASandie Peggie's views had 'no
OL,4,Abearing' on refusing legal support,
OL,5,Aunion says
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorman Provan, the union's associate
OL,8,Fdirector, told the tribunal that he
OL,9,Fconsidered Peggie's request for legal
OL,10,Fadvice, but decided against it because
OL,11,Fshe had independently sought her own
OL,12,Fsolicitor.
OL,14,FHe said the nurse's views had "no
OL,15,Fbearing" on this decision.
